---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Complaints Procedure | Smart Accounting Solutions';
const description = 'How to raise a complaint with Smart Accounting Solutions and what to expect from us.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
  <section class="section policy">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1 class="h2">Complaints Procedure</h1>
      <hr class="gold-divider" />
      <p class="lead">
        We want you to be happy with our service. If something's gone wrong, please tell us.
        Most things can be sorted out quickly with a simple phone call.
      </p>

      <div class="policy-body">
        <h2 class="h3">At a Glance</h2>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>The fastest way to sort a problem out is to call us on <a href="tel:+441143493311">0114 3493311</a>.</li>
          <li>You can also email us if you'd prefer.</li>
          <li>We'll always confirm we've received your complaint and keep you updated.</li>
          <li>Still not happy? You have the right to seek professional advice.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h3">Call Us First</h2>
        <p>
          Most complaints can be sorted out there and then with a quick phone call. If something
          isn't right, call us on <a href="tel:+441143493311">0114 3493311</a> and ask to speak to
          a member of the team. We'll listen, look into it, and do what we can to put things right
          straight away. We aim to resolve most complaints within 2 working days.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Prefer It In Writing?</h2>
        <p>If your complaint is more detailed, or you'd rather put it in writing, you can also reach us by email.</p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>Email <a href="mailto:complaints@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk">complaints@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk</a></li>
          <li>It helps us if you can include your name, contact details, and as much detail as possible, including any relevant dates or documents.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h3">If We Can't Sort It Straight Away</h2>
        <p>Sometimes a complaint needs a closer look. If that's the case, here's what you can expect.</p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>We'll confirm we've received your complaint and let you know who's looking into it.</li>
          <li>We'll look into what happened. This might mean reviewing your file or speaking with the team involved.</li>
          <li>We'll come back to you with what we've found and, where needed, what we're doing to put things right.</li>
          <li>If your complaint is more complex, it may take a little longer to fully resolve, but we'll keep you updated throughout, rather than leaving you waiting in silence. We aim to resolve these within 14 working days.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h3">If You're Still Not Happy</h2>
        <p>
          If you're unhappy with how we've handled things, let us know and we'll arrange for
          someone who wasn't originally involved to review the matter. Please note that there
          may be a cost associated with this review.
        </p>
        <p>
          Making a complaint will not affect how we treat you. You will not be treated unfairly
          or disadvantaged in any way as a result of raising a concern.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you remain unhappy following the review, you have the right to seek independent
          professional advice. Any costs associated with obtaining such advice will be your
          responsibility.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you'd like to make a complaint, or have any questions about this procedure, please contact us.</p>
        <ul class="policy-contact">
          <li><span>Email</span> <a href="mailto:complaints@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk">complaints@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk</a></li>
          <li><span>Phone</span> <a href="tel:+441143493311">0114 3493311</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy-body { margin-top: var(--space-6); }

  .h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    color: var(--sas-purple-deep);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-size: 21px;
    margin: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-3);
  }
  .h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  .policy-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }
  .policy-body a { color: var(--action-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .policy-body a:hover { color: var(--action-primary-hover); }

  .policy-list {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .policy-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  .policy-contact {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .policy-contact li { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--text-body); }
  .policy-contact span { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-heading); margin-right: 6px; }
  .policy-contact a { color: var(--action-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .policy-contact a:hover { color: var(--action-primary-hover); }
</style>
